WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:26.730
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:27.000 --> 01:30.000
"Tamed."

3
02:02.159 --> 02:03.159
Don't be scared.

4
02:03.159 --> 02:04.159
I'm here.

5
02:04.760 --> 02:05.919
Don't be scared.

6
02:05.920 --> 02:06.920
I'm here.

7
02:16.000 --> 02:20.000
(EP 1: Taking Home a Stray "Puppy")

8
02:26.360 --> 02:28.919
"Cheng Yu'an" Deep hypnosis only treats your symptoms.

9
02:29.360 --> 02:31.240
What you need is a stable relationship.

10
02:31.759 --> 02:32.759
Or...

11
02:33.719 --> 02:35.319
a pet to keep you company.

12
03:04.960 --> 03:05.960
Morning, Lawyer Cheng.

13
03:06.199 --> 03:06.560
Lawyer Cheng.

14
03:06.960 --> 03:07.840
About the Lin Yuanshan case.

15
03:07.841 --> 03:09.256
Chairman Cheng has new instructions.

16
03:09.280 --> 03:09.919
Understood.

17
03:09.919 --> 03:10.520
We'll talk after.

18
03:10.520 --> 03:11.520
Of course.

19
03:14.579 --> 03:16.592
[Settlement Agreement]

20
03:17.080 --> 03:18.975
(Wang Xuan) The third additional clause.

21
03:19.000 --> 03:21.359
No objection from your side within 72 hours

22
03:21.360 --> 03:22.439
constitutes acceptance.

23
03:23.599 --> 03:24.719
You're out of the game.

24
03:25.639 --> 03:26.639
Cheng Yu'an!

25
03:26.960 --> 03:28.039
You've gone too far!

26
03:28.599 --> 03:30.039
Don't think I don't fucking know.

27
03:30.400 --> 03:32.039
You set this whole thing up!

28
03:33.759 --> 03:34.879
However,

29
03:35.000 --> 03:36.560
if you'd like to take this further,

30
03:37.039 --> 03:38.120
I'd be happy to oblige.

31
03:39.000 --> 03:42.645
(Cheng Yuze) Those songs were mine to begin with.

32
03:43.319 --> 03:45.120
But I love seeing you like this.

33
03:45.400 --> 03:47.079
You can't stand me,

34
03:47.080 --> 03:48.439
but you can't beat my brother.

35
03:57.039 --> 03:58.199
Lawyer Cheng.

36
03:58.520 --> 04:00.319
You really love going for the jugular.

37
04:01.759 --> 04:07.360
Is that how Cheng Group handled the Lin Yuanshan case, too?

38
04:17.439 --> 04:20.759
This settlement agreement will expire at 9 a.m. tomorrow.

39
04:22.079 --> 04:23.079
After that,

40
04:23.560 --> 04:25.279
we'll have our showdown in court.

41
04:33.120 --> 04:34.638
Send me the address of Lin Yuanshan's gallery.

42
04:34.639 --> 04:35.639
I'll go over there.

43
04:36.519 --> 04:37.360
Brother!

44
04:37.361 --> 04:38.599
You were amazing back there.

45
04:38.600 --> 04:39.560
I'm serious.

46
04:39.561 --> 04:41.000
That old guy was livid!

47
04:41.240 --> 04:43.680
Cheng Yuze's brother never loses. Ask anyone.

48
04:44.120 --> 04:45.318
What were they thinking,

49
04:45.319 --> 04:46.759
coming here to pick a fight?

50
04:50.439 --> 04:51.959
Try staying out of trouble next time.

51
04:52.560 --> 04:53.800
All right, I get it.

52
04:56.279 --> 04:56.800
Brother.

53
04:56.800 --> 04:57.560
Where will you go?

54
04:57.680 --> 04:58.680
Let me come with you.

55
04:58.800 --> 04:59.800
No need.

56
05:07.040 --> 05:08.480
I threw your stuff out.

57
05:08.959 --> 05:10.680
Can't afford rent? Don't rent a place.

58
05:13.300 --> 05:16.300
(Lin Qi / Lin Yuanshan's son)

59
06:01.360 --> 06:02.360
Stop!

60
06:02.720 --> 06:04.079
I said stop!

61
06:04.160 --> 06:05.399
Those are my dad's paintings!

62
06:05.779 --> 06:06.779
(Zhao Tu) Listen, kid.

63
06:07.079 --> 06:08.079
Don't blame me.

64
06:08.920 --> 06:10.160
Your dad's paintings...

65
06:10.560 --> 06:12.319
When he was alive, they were art.

66
06:12.600 --> 06:13.800
Now he's dead, they're assets.

67
06:14.360 --> 06:15.800
He owed me a fortune.

68
06:16.319 --> 06:19.040
Don't I get to decide what happens to them?

69
06:19.240 --> 06:20.639
One less painting on the market,

70
06:21.160 --> 06:22.959
and the rest will go up by 30%.

71
06:23.160 --> 06:24.319
Let go of me!

72
06:24.800 --> 06:26.399
My dad was framed!

73
06:26.439 --> 06:27.720
He never owed anyone money!

74
06:29.839 --> 06:33.160
Each painting we burn will make the rest worth more.

75
06:33.720 --> 06:35.079
You should be happy.

76
06:44.160 --> 06:45.160
You...

77
06:54.399 --> 06:55.319
Please stop burning them!

78
06:55.319 --> 06:56.319
I'm begging you!

79
06:56.319 --> 06:57.319
Begging?

80
06:58.120 --> 06:59.720
What the fuck have you got to offer?

81
07:18.120 --> 07:19.800
Isn't that Lin Yuanshan's son?

82
07:20.160 --> 07:21.239
Yeah.

83
07:21.240 --> 07:23.199
Lin Yuanshan used to have it all.

84
07:23.720 --> 07:25.759
Now his son doesn't even have a home.

85
07:43.519 --> 07:44.519
Bro,

86
07:44.800 --> 07:45.800
Should we go after him?

87
07:48.800 --> 07:50.120
Let him go.

88
07:50.639 --> 07:51.879
Interesting.

89
08:07.480 --> 08:08.600
What are you doing here?

90
08:08.800 --> 08:11.199
Waiting for Mommy to buy me candy.

91
08:12.785 --> 08:14.186
You'll catch a cold in the rain.

92
08:17.759 --> 08:18.759
Sweetie!

93
08:18.800 --> 08:20.040
I've got your cotton candy.

94
08:20.240 --> 08:21.240
Come here!

95
08:21.800 --> 08:23.278
Big brother, you're hurt.

96
08:23.279 --> 08:24.360
You need to cover up.

97
08:27.605 --> 08:28.485
It doesn't hurt.

98
08:28.800 --> 08:29.439
I'm okay.

99
08:29.800 --> 08:30.800
But...

100
08:32.772 --> 08:34.933
Take your umbrella. Don't run too fast.

101
08:35.159 --> 08:37.120
Big brother will go fight monsters, too.

102
08:37.726 --> 08:38.726
You can do it!

103
08:38.986 --> 08:40.106
Bye, big brother!

104
08:40.273 --> 08:41.273
Slow down!

105
08:56.840 --> 08:57.840
Mr. Lin Qi.

106
08:58.016 --> 09:00.255
Your mother, Chen Ruosheng, has an unpaid balance

107
09:00.279 --> 09:02.200
of 69,800 yuan for her hospital treatment.

108
09:02.519 --> 09:04.279
Please pay within three days

109
09:04.320 --> 09:05.760
to avoid interrupting her treatment.

110
09:41.679 --> 09:42.799
That's mine.

111
09:44.200 --> 09:45.200
What's the name?

112
09:45.399 --> 09:46.159
Lin Qi.

113
09:46.159 --> 09:47.159
Qi, as in 'to perch'.

114
09:49.879 --> 09:50.879
I meant the medication.

115
09:52.399 --> 09:53.399
Fluoxetine.

116
09:58.679 --> 09:59.720
Thanks.

117
10:01.600 --> 10:02.799
You take it, too?

118
10:06.720 --> 10:08.160
How are you related to Lin Yuanshan?

119
10:08.360 --> 10:09.360
He's my dad.

120
10:19.600 --> 10:20.600
Get in.

121
10:21.200 --> 10:22.200
What?

122
10:22.399 --> 10:23.799
You can stay here

123
10:24.159 --> 10:25.798
and run into those thugs again.

124
10:25.799 --> 10:26.799
Or...

125
10:27.080 --> 10:28.399
get in my car.

126
10:28.840 --> 10:29.840
Now.

127
10:30.519 --> 10:31.519
I'll...

128
10:35.665 --> 10:38.625
I'll take you to get your wounds treated. I bumped into you earlier.

129
10:39.360 --> 10:40.679
In 30 seconds,

130
10:40.919 --> 10:42.200
I will drive away.

131
11:04.853 --> 11:06.626
[Cheng Yuze]

132
11:06.720 --> 11:07.279
Brother.

133
11:07.340 --> 11:08.220
Can you do me a favor?

134
11:08.320 --> 11:09.000
It's urgent.

135
11:09.120 --> 11:10.120
What is it?

136
11:10.600 --> 11:11.279
I just found out.

137
11:11.280 --> 11:13.320
Lin Yuanshan, that painter he mentioned...

138
11:13.480 --> 11:15.440
His son goes to the Academy of Fine Arts with me.

139
11:15.840 --> 11:17.240
After what happened to his dad,

140
11:17.480 --> 11:18.720
his mom fell into a coma, too.

141
11:18.799 --> 11:20.240
Debt collectors hound him every day.

142
11:20.480 --> 11:21.399
Now I can't reach him.

143
11:21.399 --> 11:22.399
I want to help him.

144
11:22.840 --> 11:24.719
Can you use your contacts to find him?

145
11:24.720 --> 11:25.720
Brother?

146
11:26.279 --> 11:27.840
He's already in my car.

147
11:53.846 --> 11:56.459
[Shen Mo, Therapist]

148
12:23.200 --> 12:24.200
Come in.

149
12:36.600 --> 12:38.720
The container's a little dirty.

150
12:55.759 --> 12:56.759
Change your shoes.

151
13:48.879 --> 13:49.879
Come here.

152
13:50.240 --> 13:51.240
Clean yourself up.

153
15:26.840 --> 15:27.840
Zafe.

154
15:29.360 --> 15:30.840
That's my name.

155
15:32.039 --> 15:33.039
Say it.

156
15:34.279 --> 15:35.279
Zafe.

157
15:36.519 --> 15:37.519
What's yours?

158
15:37.840 --> 15:38.840
It doesn't matter.

159
15:51.639 --> 15:52.639
Hold still.

160
16:02.000 --> 16:02.919
It hurts.

161
16:03.000 --> 16:04.000
Hold still.

162
16:04.519 --> 16:05.519
Be good.

163
16:11.759 --> 16:12.759
Look at me.

164
16:14.039 --> 16:15.080
Don't hold back.

165
16:16.879 --> 16:17.879
Keep going.

166
17:08.400 --> 17:09.480
You're a lot like it.

167
17:11.680 --> 17:12.680
What?

168
17:14.799 --> 17:15.799
Nothing.

169
17:22.025 --> 17:23.279
You're friends with Cheng Yuze?

170
17:25.160 --> 17:26.160
We're close.

171
17:37.440 --> 17:38.480
You need a place to stay?

172
17:38.920 --> 17:39.920
Yes.

173
17:40.119 --> 17:41.279
If you'll let me,

174
17:41.799 --> 17:43.359
I could pay you with my paintings.

175
17:43.792 --> 17:44.799
Will you get famous?

176
17:47.519 --> 17:48.519
A painting...

177
17:49.720 --> 17:51.519
It's only valuable once the artist dies.

178
17:54.559 --> 17:55.640
But...

179
17:57.240 --> 17:59.000
I don't have anything else.

180
18:19.279 --> 18:21.200
Right now, I need a pet.

181
18:21.839 --> 18:23.160
And a stable relationship.

182
18:23.559 --> 18:24.640
If you're willing,

183
18:26.599 --> 18:27.720
you can stay here.

184
18:28.519 --> 18:30.200
I'll help you with the rest.

185
18:30.920 --> 18:31.920
Twenty-one days.

186
18:33.039 --> 18:34.039
A trial period.

187
18:36.359 --> 18:37.480
A pet?

188
18:37.880 --> 18:38.960
It's just a label.

189
18:39.839 --> 18:41.640
Companionship that provides emotional value.

190
18:42.000 --> 18:43.000
Of course,

191
18:44.039 --> 18:45.240
you can say no.

192
19:02.606 --> 19:03.752
[Chen Ruosheng, Mother to Lin [Qi]]

193
19:03.777 --> 19:04.806
[Hospital bill for over 5000 yuan]

194
19:19.200 --> 19:21.039
You asked me about Lin Yuanshan.

195
19:21.640 --> 19:23.240
You know about his case,

196
19:23.640 --> 19:24.759
don't you?

197
19:26.720 --> 19:27.720
Yes.

198
19:33.960 --> 19:34.960
I'll do it.

199
19:36.720 --> 19:39.160
I need money for my mom's medical bills.

200
19:41.079 --> 19:42.079
Could you help?

201
19:46.119 --> 19:47.119
Your account number.

202
20:12.240 --> 20:13.559
He's so much like you.

203
20:14.799 --> 20:15.799
Xiao Qi.

204
20:30.839 --> 20:31.936
You'll sleep in the guest room.

205
20:31.960 --> 20:33.039
Twenty-one days.

206
20:33.359 --> 20:34.359
Sign this.

207
20:34.519 --> 20:36.200
You can still back out before you sign.

208
20:49.416 --> 20:51.256
[1st episode: over]

209
20:51.740 --> 20:52.619
Lawyer Cheng.

210
20:52.620 --> 20:54.098
I've sent some files on the Lin Yuanshan case

211
20:54.099 --> 20:55.500
to your phone.

212
20:56.643 --> 20:59.583
[Lin Yuanshan's son Lin Qi. Places he frequents: The corner store on Hui'an Road, the hospital]

213
21:06.819 --> 21:07.940
What are you doing here?

214
21:18.099 --> 21:19.460
Why are you all alone?

215
21:20.700 --> 21:21.819
Where's your owner?

216
21:24.099 --> 21:25.420
What's your name?

217
21:35.019 --> 21:35.859
Lawyer Cheng.

218
21:35.860 --> 21:37.379
The fluoxetine I bought you today...

219
21:37.380 --> 21:38.380
You left it at the office.

220
21:38.381 --> 21:39.460
Should I bring it over?

221
21:39.660 --> 21:40.140
No.

222
21:40.299 --> 21:41.299
I'll buy some myself.

223
21:44.680 --> 21:45.319
(Next Episode) Brother.

224
21:45.320 --> 21:46.359
Who's this?

225
21:46.700 --> 21:47.700
Shen Mo.

226
21:47.880 --> 21:48.880
A therapist.

227
21:49.140 --> 21:49.900
Dr. Shen.

228
21:50.079 --> 21:52.339
Could I get a private bedtime session?

229
21:52.480 --> 21:53.279
Brother Yu'an.

230
21:53.359 --> 21:54.359
Do you have a pet, too?

231
21:58.460 --> 21:59.019
Cheers!

232
21:59.019 --> 21:59.420
Cheers!

233
21:59.420 --> 22:00.019
Cheers!

234
22:00.259 --> 22:01.660
Truth or dare?

235
22:02.779 --> 22:03.420
Dare.

236
22:03.740 --> 22:05.939
The third person to your right...

237
22:05.940 --> 22:07.740
Hold their gaze for 30 seconds.

238
22:19.559 --> 22:20.160
Brother?

239
22:20.420 --> 22:21.420
Are you at home?
